And by that you're helping
them get to success faster.

00:23:04.930 --> 00:23:07.140
You're accelerating the growth.

00:23:07.140 --> 00:23:08.540
- And I had to learn Hope,

00:23:08.540 --> 00:23:10.130
that I wasn't to your point.

00:23:10.130 --> 00:23:11.260
And that's why I did well early on.

00:23:11.260 --> 00:23:13.940
Cause I was, but then as I got stretched,

00:23:13.940 --> 00:23:18.650
then I realized and my financial
situation changed, you know

00:23:18.650 --> 00:23:22.400
because I started over at 34
and didn't have a lot of money.

00:23:22.400 --> 00:23:24.670
Like every dollar was like petrified.

00:23:24.670 --> 00:23:26.090
And even though I wrote it off,

00:23:26.090 --> 00:23:28.170
I really wanted it to win.

00:23:28.170 --> 00:23:31.010
Whereas now, I realized, Ugh,

00:23:31.010 --> 00:23:33.760
you know in this kind of like
mockery place three years ago,

00:23:33.760 --> 00:23:34.593
four years ago,

00:23:34.593 --> 00:23:35.560
which is why I changed my behavior.

00:23:35.560 --> 00:23:37.870
I'm like, Ooh, I'm writing like a 100 K,

00:23:37.870 --> 00:23:38.910
which means a lot to me.

00:23:38.910 --> 00:23:40.430
I came from nothing,

00:23:40.430 --> 00:23:43.540
but it's not enough to
make me go do something.

00:23:43.540 --> 00:23:44.730
They're not reaching out to me.

00:23:44.730 --> 00:23:46.620
I'm running their company.

00:23:46.620 --> 00:23:49.360
And might to your point
might impact on it,

00:23:49.360 --> 00:23:51.490
was far less than the early stuff.

00:23:51.490 --> 00:23:53.130
And far less than the last three or four

00:23:53.130 --> 00:23:54.820
that I got involved with.

00:23:54.820 --> 00:23:57.350
You know, for say MikMak,
I went on the board

00:23:57.350 --> 00:23:59.520
you know, like and it's
close to VaynerMedia

00:23:59.520 --> 00:24:02.050
so I can send Rachel
clients and she's like me.

00:24:02.050 --> 00:24:04.570
So I can tutor or mentor.

00:24:04.570 --> 00:24:05.830
That's such a great point.

00:24:05.830 --> 00:24:10.830
I have some level of impact
to your 0.99% dollars.

00:24:10.990 --> 00:24:13.030
You're passive and it's not liquid.

00:24:13.030 --> 00:24:15.067
And it's 99% likely to go away.

00:24:15.067 --> 00:24:17.700
- But I think you also are talking about,

00:24:17.700 --> 00:24:19.530
it's not just your investment.

00:24:19.530 --> 00:24:21.700
You also are taking the interest.

00:24:21.700 --> 00:24:24.070
Like when you have an
interest in the company

00:24:24.070 --> 00:24:25.380
and in the people,

00:24:25.380 --> 00:24:27.680
that's when you unlock your magic.

00:24:27.680 --> 00:24:29.933
It's not just a passive investment

00:24:29.933 --> 00:24:30.766
and then you watch.

00:24:30.766 --> 00:24:32.780
- But Self-awareness,

00:24:32.780 --> 00:24:34.690
one of the things that I
really want to talk about,

00:24:34.690 --> 00:24:36.290
and I'm going to let you two take over.

00:24:36.290 --> 00:24:39.720
It's like, and of course
we're talking generalizations.

00:24:39.720 --> 00:24:42.600
So like, let there be no
confusion, every human's different.

00:24:42.600 --> 00:24:44.810
But when we think about this show,

00:24:44.810 --> 00:24:46.930
especially from the female lens,

00:24:46.930 --> 00:24:50.370
you know I think one thing I
look for a lot is self esteem,

00:24:50.370 --> 00:24:52.334
and self awareness, right?

00:24:52.334 --> 00:24:55.150
And I do think that that is something

00:24:55.150 --> 00:24:57.110
