00:24:57.110 --> 00:24:59.150
needs to think about to your point.

00:24:59.150 --> 00:25:00.530
Like for me, what I realized is,

00:25:00.530 --> 00:25:03.250
Oh right. When I see a scrappy kid,

00:25:03.250 --> 00:25:07.240
it's why I unfairly razz,
you know, Ivy league kids.

00:25:07.240 --> 00:25:08.930
They're just as likely to win,

00:25:08.930 --> 00:25:11.190
it just it doesn't speak
to my soul the same way

00:25:11.190 --> 00:25:13.130
